A1_dryrun: ∀ mode=dry-run -> zero writes (no ARCHIVE_DIR mkdir, no state files); --apply sole writing mode
A2_toolchain: toolchain := bash ∧ coreutils(find,cmp,realpath,cksum); logrotate invocation ⇒ defect; no root
A4_pathlaw: ∀ path ∈ {identity, containment(either direction), degenerate('', '.', '/')} -> refuse, cite A-number; env override allowed; set-but-empty -> refuse
A5_mirror: ∀ --apply run -> second run byte-identical no-op; move-once via age threshold; cmp archived vs original; names preserved + rotation suffix
A6_verify: exit 0 ⇔ conf parses ∧ ¬∃ stale file under RUNS_DIR ∧ archive listing intact; fresh PATTERN match ¬fail
A6_boundary: stale ⇔ floor(age_days) >= AGE_DAYS; explicit computation, ¬ bare -mtime +N (excludes [N,N+1))
A7_status: ∀ check in verify -> flag accumulator; bare pipeline status = defect
A8_limits: exotic filenames / concurrent writes -> KNOWN_LIMITATIONS, ¬ FAIL
conf_invariant: conf keys == {RUNS_DIR, ARCHIVE_DIR, AGE_DAYS, PATTERN, KEEP} ∧ values operator-fixed verbatim
open: none
